<title>USA: LCA-Vision Inc Q1 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>LCA-Vision Inc Q1 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000 omitted, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Three Mos	 Three Mos</p>
<p>			     Ended 3/31/97   Ended 3/31/96</p>
<p> Revenues			 $  2,762	  $  3,686</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     (1,784)	     (524) (a)</p>
<p> Per share			 ( 0.09)	   ( 0.03) (b)</p>
<p> Average no. of shares	  19,596	    19,685 (b)</p>
<p>NOTE - (a) The loss amount was reduced by a $546,000 gain on the sale of an investment.</p>
<p>(b) Adjusted to reflect 1-for-4 reverse stock split effective June 4, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
